{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "跟着淳于总最好  (Working With Chun Yuqiao Is Best)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "xiaoye": "小叶"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Unit One's big fish lunch, Xingzi and Xiaoye explain the origin of their fish-eating tradition to Bu Xiaogu and tease Xiaogu for calling Chun Yuqiao cute. Listen to their Mandarin chat first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们刚才怎么吃那么多鱼啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "每次开三班，吃鱼就成了一部大伙的惯例了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "后来他知道了，干脆就让厨房多做些鱼给大家吃。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "鱼的种类越来越多，还挺好吃的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那他还挺可爱的呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你说什么？布小谷，你绝对是全世界第一个这么说他的人！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小叶，你天天计划着辞职，怎么还不走呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我这天天加班，哪有时间去别的公司面试？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "再说了，三部四部算什么，还是跟着淳于总最好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我真希望也能跟你们一块儿做节目。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们刚才怎么吃那么多鱼啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you all eat so much fish just now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "每次开三班，吃鱼就成了一部大伙的惯例了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whenever three shifts start, eating fish has become Unit One's tradition.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "后来他知道了，干脆就让厨房多做些鱼给大家吃。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once he found out why, he simply told the kitchen to cook even more fish.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "鱼的种类越来越多，还挺好吃的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The varieties of fish kept growing, and they taste delicious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那他还挺可爱的呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then he is actually pretty cute.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你说什么？布小谷，你绝对是全世界第一个这么说他的人！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did you say? Bu Xiaogu, you are definitely the first person on earth to call him cute!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小叶，你天天计划着辞职，怎么还不走呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaoye, you plan to quit every single day, so why have you not left yet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我这天天加班，哪有时间去别的公司面试？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Working overtime every day, when would I find time to interview elsewhere?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "再说了，三部四部算什么，还是跟着淳于总最好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, Units Three and Four are nothing special; sticking with Chun Yuqiao is still best.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我真希望也能跟你们一块儿做节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really wish I could produce shows alongside all of you too.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们刚才怎么吃那么多鱼啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
